&lt;p&gt;We are not saying "kill Sentry." We are saying: if the job is &lt;strong&gt;exceptions on a cheap VPS&lt;/strong&gt;, the 65-container install is the wrong unit of deployment.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Epure is exception-only. Official SDKs + DSN. Not "100% Sentry compatible." If your checklist includes replay, APM, or profiling, stop here and pick a suite that actually ships those.&lt;/p&gt;

